Output docs/demo.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "Iosevka"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1120
Set Height 530
Set Padding 10
Set Framerate 25
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Type "dotamp --silent"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "/"
Sleep 400ms
Type "play deep"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Down
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Tab
Sleep 9s
Type "v"
Sleep 9s
Type "v"
Sleep 12s
Type "v"
Sleep 9s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
